</section>

<!-- Core Ecosystem Modules -->
<div class="container-fluid px-5" style="max-width: 1700px;">
    <h2 class="section-header">// ENTERPRISE RETAIL TELEMETRY MODULES //</h2>
    
    <div class="row g-4">
        <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6">
            <div class="feature-card">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-cash-register feature-icon" style="color: var(--cyber-cyan);"></i>
                <h3 class="feature-title">SMART TERMINAL HUD</h3>
                <p class="feature-desc">High-speed point of sale workspace with ergonomic 3-column topology. Instant barcode scanning via pre-warmed RAM hash maps and automated receipt thermal structuring.</p>
                <div style="margin-top: 20px; font-family:'VT323'; color:var(--cyber-cyan); font-size:1.1rem;">> LATENCY: &lt; 5ms_</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6">
            <div class="feature-card">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-cloud-arrow-up feature-icon" style="color: var(--cyber-emerald);"></i>
                <h3 class="feature-title">DIGITAL SAAS LICENSE</h3>
                <p class="feature-desc">Flexible software pricing plans (NODE.ALPHA, NODE.PRIME, NODE.OMEGA) tailored for single boutique storefronts up to multitenant national retail hypermarkets.</p>
                <div style="margin-top: 20px; font-family:'VT323'; color:var(--cyber-emerald); font-size:1.1rem;">> DEPLOYMENT: CLOUD_READY_</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6">
            <div class="feature-card">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-warehouse feature-icon" style="color: var(--cyber-amber);"></i>
                <h3 class="feature-title">REALTIME WAREHOUSE</h3>
                <p class="feature-desc">Strict stock accounting with Optimistic Concurrency tokens (`RowVersion`). Automated stock vouchers, transfer slips, and supplier debt accounting audits.</p>
                <div style="margin-top: 20px; font-family:'VT323'; color:var(--cyber-amber); font-size:1.1rem;">> LOCK_ENGINE: OPTIMISTIC_</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6">
            <div class="feature-card">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-user-lock feature-icon" style="color: var(--cyber-danger);"></i>
                <h3 class="feature-title">SELF-SERVICE IAM</h3>
                <p class="feature-desc">Granular RBAC access policies separating operators from core financials. Equipped with biometric employee avatar uploading and automatic cryptographic GUID anonymization.</p>
                <div style="margin-top: 20px; font-family:'VT323'; color:var(--cyber-danger); font-size:1.1rem;">> SECURITY: ZERO_TRUST_</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- SaaS Digital Package Showcase Banner -->
